 "nodes": {
  "784360404": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Ah, it’s you. I’ve been reviewing your records.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2145821092": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You’re quite an intriguing subject.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1832701301": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You’ve sustained injuries that would incapacitate an average person, yet you recover quickly and show resilience. Fascinating.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2107859638": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It got me thinking… You might be a suitable candidate for a more unconventional line of treatment I’ve been developing. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "433715102": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Experimental, of course. It’s designed to increase strength, stamina, and overall combat capabilities.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1729620493": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "However, there’s a complication. It’s not covered by insurance, naturally. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1489109523": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Experimental procedures like these tend to cost a substantial amount… and I have no budget to cover your treatment.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1815315669": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1230726825,
    -1549302636,
    1937613046,
    -597636501
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So, if you’re willing to bear the cost, we can begin immediately. If not, feel free to leave. The choice is yours.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1230726825": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1815315669,
   "children": [
    -1122565652,
    1015121981,
    -1099651809
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What exactly does this treatment do?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1549302636": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1815315669,
   "children": [
    -255122016,
    -1221779385,
    -1276664021
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Sounds risky. What are the side effects?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1937613046": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1815315669,
   "children": [
    1041397706
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’m interested. Let’s do it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-597636501": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1815315669,
   "children": [
    1142696288,
    1308410951
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’m not paying for some experiment. I’ll pass.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1122565652": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1230726825,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "In essence, it enhances muscle fiber density and neural response time. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-255122016": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1549302636,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Common side effects include fatigue, nausea, migraines… and in rare cases, temporary loss of motor function. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1041397706": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1937613046,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Very well. I’ll make the necessary arrangements. Payment must be made up front. Once we start, there’s no turning back.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1142696288": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -597636501,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Suit yourself. I’m not in the business of persuasion. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1015121981": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1230726825,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Think of it as pushing your body past its natural limits—becoming stronger, faster, more resilient.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1221779385": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1549302636,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But you strike me as someone accustomed to risk, yes?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1308410951": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -597636501,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "When you’re ready to exceed your limits—or if you change your mind—you know where to find me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1099651809": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1230726825,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m not in the business of persuasion. When you’re ready to exceed your limits, you know where to find me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1276664021": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1549302636,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m not in the business of persuasion. When you’re ready to exceed your limits, you know where to find me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
